# The image builds from the workspace manifests, the engine, the server and the console. Nothing else goes in,
# and never a database, a secret or someone's node_modules.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-single
**/test
**/*.log
**/.data
**/*.db*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.claude
docs
coverage
apps/site/*
!apps/site/package.json
